# Billing

Prices live in `@rayt-me/plan-pricing`. Do not invent a second price table.

| Tier | Price | Given / month |
|---|---|---|
| Basic | $0 | 25 |
| Pro | $27 / year | 60 |
| Business | $21 / employee / year | 50 per employee |

Received ratings are unlimited on every tier. iOS does not sell plans in-app. Billing provider default is `disabled`; never `sandbox` on production. Super Voter is not a paid SKU. One server `OPENAI_API_KEY` (default model `gpt-5-mini`).

```ts
// ❌ BAD — cap ratings a Basic user receives
if (tier === 'basic' && received >= 25) reject()

// ✅ GOOD — cap ratings given
if (givenThisMonth >= capFor(tier)) rejectGive()
```
